#: tips:257
msgid "MIME types"
msgstr "MIME 形式"

#: tips:258
msgid "The filer uses a set of rules to work out the correct MIME type for each regular file, and then chooses a suitable icon for that type."
msgstr "ROX は標準的なルールに従ってファイルの MIME 形式を判別し、適切なアイコンを設定します。"

#: tips:259
msgid "Edit MIME rules"
msgstr "MIME ルール編集"

#: tips:260
msgid "Themes"
msgstr "テーマ"

#: tips:261
msgid "Icon theme"
